Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monochromon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I love my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lose my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.89,0:01:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I won't lose my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lose my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lose my love.\NI won't lose my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found Andromon trapped\Ninside a mysterious factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After he was free, he\Nbecame a destructive maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.48,0:01:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I discovered a chamber with a computer\Nprogram that ran the entire facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.84,0:01:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, my laptop inside\Nthis perimeter was operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Accessing the mainframe, I somehow\Ntapped into Tentamon's programming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.40,0:01:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did evolve to Kabuterimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:02:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and with the help of Raymon and\NGolurumon, he defeated Andromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.42,0:02:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Andrumon's programming had\Nbeen corrupted by another black gear.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.59,0:02:15.02,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Palmon's Angry Evolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.47,0:02:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angry Evolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.52,0:02:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all the strange things that\Nhappened to us on Digimon Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never expected to find a\Nsecret admirer in the sewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.40,0:02:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, everybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's sing the song that Agumon wrote for\Nus Digimon eat and Digimon fight Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digivolve and fight all night Singing sure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is fun Now let's try\Nsome solo performances,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.82,0:02:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Singing mercy Oh, give me a\Nhome where the buffalo roam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avoiding your drone Hey, come on, I had\Nsinging lessons for three years Oh, you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did it help?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, you should get a refund.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.02,0:02:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's sing as a group. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.84,0:03:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon fight and Digimon fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.46,0:03:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, and the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, some water fell from up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That made you scream?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.66,0:03:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I used to sing at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to sing to myself all the\Ntime when I would do my chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.28,0:03:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially when I'd hang\Nclothes to dry outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd sing really loud, because\Nnobody could hear me then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay to miss your home, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.76,0:03:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you miss, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I miss playing sports, then\Ntaking a nice hot bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.32,0:03:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Games.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.23,0:03:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My games.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.46,0:03:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't far from beating\NMatt on my video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beating me, TK?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe in your dreams, kiddo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.90,0:04:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you don't miss\Nanything from home, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.02,0:04:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, now that you mention it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.82,0:04:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been dreaming about Sunday\Nwhen Mom grilled the steaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, makes my mouth water
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I miss doing my homework\NIf I fall too far behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might have to go to a junior college
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't miss school
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I do miss going on vacation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing beats having a\Ncool drink on a summer
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,day at the beach I just\Nlove the ocean air Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait, that sounds like fun, Mimi It is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.22,0:04:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a grip I miss accessing satellites\Nto look at the stars and planets
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They really do come from another world
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why they are depressed Poor kids
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.66,0:04:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet, listen everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eew! Numemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:05:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're really disgusting\NDigimon who live down
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here in the sewers. That's\Ngross. And so are they.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.94,0:05:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they really strong? No,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.98,0:05:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're weak but smelly\NJust wait till they
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.92,0:05:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get closer Then what do you say we leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.28,0:05:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or am I the only one who doesn't want\Nto get stomped by stinky sewer dwellers?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's so many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're not strong, why\Ndo we have to run from them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see. Keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.92,0:05:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.28,0:05:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These sewer-dwelling Numemon were,\Nlike, totally hygiene deficient.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.50,0:05:43.46,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Numemon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.50,0:05:43.46,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Mollusk Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.50,0:05:43.46,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.50,0:05:43.46,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.50,0:05:43.46,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.50,0:05:43.46,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.50,0:05:43.46,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Poop
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They loved throwing Noom sludge at\Nyou, and they had bad breath, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.70,0:05:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't even go after me! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing that's able to\Ndrive them away is the sunshine
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness. We finally escaped\Nthose Numemons once we got outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't see anything else for miles\NUntil we saw the strangest thing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be thousands\Nof them I'd say under a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.90,0:06:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hundred Or maybe just fifty\NHow did they get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.96,0:07:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet there's enough snacks to\Nlast us a lifetime At least Mimi,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they probably don't work Don't\Nyou remember the phone booths?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.06,0:07:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that could be I bet it's a trick,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.18,0:07:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi I won't accept that Even if they're\Nreal You know they're not plugged in
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.40,0:07:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay, Soda. You want one? No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.68,0:07:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to bite my head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cutie boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's their leader? Their leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't lead a pack of show\Npoodles even with his doggy breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me take you out on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.54,0:07:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.26,0:07:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got to be the hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't go near that short,\Nslimy, sewer-sliding sledge slinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.74,0:07:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi will make him mad. Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.96,0:07:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we're safe in the sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you call me\Nshort? The date's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again. Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.70,0:08:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Party time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.48,0:08:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did they get here?\NWho cares? Run, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.04,0:08:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.16,0:08:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everybody, let's split up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heartbreaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.90,0:08:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jelta!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's an Ivy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.58,0:09:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Mimi, I didn't do\Nanything. Why'd they run?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Monzaemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come visit us at Toy Town!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.39,0:09:26.35,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}MONZAEMON
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.39,0:09:26.35,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Puppet Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.39,0:09:26.35,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.39,0:09:26.35,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.39,0:09:26.35,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.39,0:09:26.35,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.39,0:09:26.35,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Lovely Attack
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.84,0:09:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monzaemon looked like a cute big old\Nteddy bear, but he wasn't very cuddly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Palmon, is he a Digimon too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, he's in charge of a\Nspecial place called Toy Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toy Town is a place where he takes\Ncare of all the abandoned Digimon toys,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and those toys love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he looks harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He always has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.98,0:09:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say, so pleased to\Nmake your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's attacking us! You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, come spend a fun\Nday at Toy Town with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you running?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.14,0:10:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I startle you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's never acted like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here, Cookie, I'll\Nprotect you. No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.18,0:10:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.28,0:10:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, about a geeky game of soccer, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.18,0:10:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.22,0:10:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something bad must happen in Toy Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I saved you, lady, now will\Nyou go out with me, huh? No. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.98,0:10:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go to Toy\NTown for our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.52,0:10:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, she's so feisty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.22,0:10:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, there it is, Mimi, Toy Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it really looks beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of like a big amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like anyone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's not right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.64,0:11:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, I'm really having a lot of fun now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fun, fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.74,0:11:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't look like a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.16,0:11:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:11:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:12:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a delightful activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.36,0:12:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This activity is really delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Izzy doesn't talk like that. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, oh boy, is this really great or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.60,0:12:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This really rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget books.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This really rocks. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.50,0:12:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't catch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.82,0:12:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't catch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't catch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't catch me. Ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody sounds like a bunch of zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, they always were a little weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I knew what was going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.27,0:12:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can anyone hear us out\Nthere? Hi? Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming from that locked chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.39,0:12:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are all our other Digimon in\Nthere with you, Agumon? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.64,0:13:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were running from the Numemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Monzaemon came along.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have fun with me at Toy Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, he runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We tried to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepper Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.68,0:13:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My flame's not working! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hearts attack! Those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.22,0:14:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Toy Town is the\Ngreatest place to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.44,0:14:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiral Twister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heart attack! Those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.48,0:14:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zara! Two more!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At Troy Town, we just oozed one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.86,0:14:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.26,0:14:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heart attack, bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So all of you will now serve us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.52,0:14:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all going into our toy box.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.02,0:14:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our toy box is only filled with children.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thinking back, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.76,0:14:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.82,0:15:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who needs bugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.48,0:15:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The toys have been playing with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aku, tell us, what changed Monzaemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, can't you get out\Nof that box and help?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we're locked inside of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.42,0:15:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up to you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.70,0:15:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be the heroes this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must defeat Monzaemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? You're kidding. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't get free until\Nyou save the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, do we have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.82,0:15:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to tell you, this isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.92,0:15:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monzymon's hearts aren't supposed\Nto attack, only give heart hugs,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which give people such a good feeling\Nthat it makes them want to help others!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop that noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:15:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's such a happy day, it's my dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Monzaemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You like these?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.64,0:16:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone likes the balloons?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yeti Teddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you've done to\Nmy friends, fix it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.94,0:16:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or you'll be in big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.36,0:16:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.84,0:16:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm being chased by a giant stuffed bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't run away from Toy-Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save you, honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.91,0:16:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You turn him down and he still helps!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.70,0:16:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Palmon, what can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.56,0:16:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you've got it, you've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.53,0:16:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think the new mislatch is working!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:16:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let them fight alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.22,0:17:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison Ivy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.90,0:17:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.06,0:17:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, please talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My poison ivy's not strong enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horsetark!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.98,0:17:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to take it to the next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be a lady, but I am not a pushover.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.74,0:18:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to show this Digimon\Nsome manners. Togemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Togemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going down, big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.44,0:18:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to dance with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.28,0:18:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Needle Spray!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.48,0:19:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.24,0:19:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, you're fabulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My skin is bruised.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After everyone was free from\Nthe spell and the trunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monzaemon told us what really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.02,0:19:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usually when kids get tired of\Ntheir toys, they just abandon them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They throw them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.55,0:19:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.24,0:19:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I created a home for these toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.10,0:19:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, I wanted to make the toys\Nmore important to their owners,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.42,0:19:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I found a way to let their\Nowners walk in their shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.62,0:19:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.53,0:19:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By turning kids into zombies?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think he really\Nintended to do that, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.48,0:19:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.46,0:19:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean for that to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really am sorry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.54,0:19:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please accept my apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.74,0:19:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.09,0:19:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monze, Mon, we know that you\Nwould never hurt us on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.08,0:19:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.44,0:19:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But an evil feeling came over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:19:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had to be that black gear. You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.86,0:20:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to take this whole\Nblack gear thing a little personally
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.00,0:20:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They cause a whole lot of trouble\Nbefore disappearing That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.82,0:20:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But me and Palmon made Monzaemon good\Nagain. We're a great team, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.84,0:20:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's only one way I can\Ntruly show my gratitude And
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's by giving you all a real\Nheart hug Oh boy Here we go
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my gift to you\NHearts attack with a hug
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumpling a kiss for your hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.12,0:20:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.64,0:21:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish. Do you think you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.92,0:21:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me. I'm just right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.84,0:21:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not all that you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.64,0:21:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold, so it's cold. It's a jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.70,0:21:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.56,0:22:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you. I
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.12,0:22:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wish
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.02,0:22:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.08,0:24:00.00,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fs30\b1}A Roar! Ikkakumon

